@MessengerWeb_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Register: 200, copy accountId from the response
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Same email in another case: 409
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": " TEST@Example.com ",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Invalid input: 400
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### Login: 200, copy accessToken from the response (401 on wrong email or password)
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

###
@jwt = paste-access-token-from-login
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Who am I: 200 (401 without a token)
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Profile before it is filled in: 404
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Create or update own profile: 204 (403 for someone else's profile)
PUT {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "bio": "Hello!"
}

### Profile after: 200
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Personal access token for an agent: 200, the token is shown only here
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my agent"
}

### My personal tokens, without secrets
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
@tokenId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Revoke a personal token: 204
DELETE {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/tokens/{{tokenId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Create a bot: 200, copy botId and token
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Helper Bot"
}

### My bots
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/bots
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
@botId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@botToken = msg_paste-bot-token

### The bot is an account too: same /api/me with its token
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{botToken}}

### Reissue the bot token: 200, the previous token stops working
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/bots/{{botId}}/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Delete the bot: 204, its tokens stop working
DELETE {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/bots/{{botId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
@otherUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Direct chat: 200 { chatId }; the same chatId again for the same pair
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/direct
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{otherUserId}}"
}

### Group chat: 200 { chatId }
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Team",
  "memberIds": ["{{otherUserId}}"]
}

### My chats, most recently active first
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
@chatId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### One chat with members (404 if you are not a member)
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Send a message: 200 { messageId, seq }
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello!"
}

### Reply to message #1
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Answer",
  "replyToSeq": 1
}

### Latest messages
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Messages newer than #1 (what an agent polls for)
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?after=1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Add a member to a group: 204 (owner or admin)
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{otherUserId}}"
}

### Make a member admin: 204 (owner only)
PUT {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members/{{otherUserId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Remove a member; your own id leaves the chat
DELETE {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/chats/{{chatId}}/members/{{otherUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###
